                    reinf_ownership:        `An orphaned returns hand-off — two teams each think the other owns it (structural)`,
                    reinf_erp:              `An ERP configured against the real work, forcing manual workarounds (process)`,
                    reinf_skills:           `A pure skills deficit — retrain all 240 on the bundle of tasks (people)`,
                    reinf_none:             `No deeper cause — the error rate is the problem; fix it directly`,

