                    r3_sequence_label:      `In what order do you sequence the levers across the six months?`,
                    seq_structurefirst:     `Structure first, then process, then capability — clarity before flow before skills`,
                    seq_processfirst:       `Process first — redesign the workflow before deciding who owns it`,
                    seq_peoplefirst:        `People first — train everyone now, on the process you're about to redesign`,
                    seq_allatonce:          `All at once — launch every lever simultaneously to move fast`,
                    r3_change_label:        `How much of the budget goes into the change-management / communication wrap?`,
                    r3_change_hint:         `$k for involvement, communication and adoption support running across every lever (drives buy-in, not headline cost).`,
                    r3_indicators_label:    `Do you define leading indicators and named owners per lever before launch?`,
