                    ind_none:               `No — measure at the end; the plan speaks for itself`,
                    r3_shock_label:         `Mid-plan shock: a key supervisor resigns AND the ERP vendor raises its quote. How do you respond?`,
                    shock_protect:          `Hold the sequence; promote a named internal owner and absorb the cost from the light-touch lever`,
