                    r4_adoption_label:      `How do you drive adoption of the redesign in a unit at 51% engagement?`,
                    adopt_involve:          `Involve the unit in designing the change; communicate the why; coach the new owners`,
                    adopt_mandate:          `Mandate it and audit compliance hard until the numbers move`,
                    adopt_email:            `Roll it out by email and a town-hall, then move on`,
